# The situation brief is written by a language model, and every figure in it is checked against the simulation.
#
# By default it uses a local Ollama model, with no setup: have Ollama running and the model pulled:
#     ollama pull qwen3.5:4b
# Nothing below is required. To change a setting, copy this file to .env.local (same folder).
# .env.local is never committed.

# BRIEF_PROVIDER=ollama
#   "ollama" or "anthropic". Empty means: Anthropic if a key is set below, otherwise Ollama.

# OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen3.5:4b
#   Any model you have pulled. A bigger one, such as qwen3.5:9b, is slower but writes better.

# OLLAMA_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434

# To use the Claude API instead (billed separately from the chat app):
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-5-5
